    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期节目的磁场有点乱，敏感体质绕行，聊到最后我家狗子直接不行了</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期节目邀请的水哥，身上有两个法脉，一个是巫系，一个是相门；都是单纯的传承，不会营销，也不会有任何夸张的行为话术，一切都是真实发生的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a> 水哥自我介绍，女巫体系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="113">01:53</a> 皇帝内经的来源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">02:29</a> 完颜阿骨打的兴盛衰败</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="337">05:37</a> 末法时代导致的现在的玄学环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 萨满和出马的天差地别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 女巫现在不被传播的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="517">08:37</a> 出马盛行的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a> 出马和保家*的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="711">11:51</a> 大仙儿的底层逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 女巫为什么看的就一定准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 前世今生 佛教、道教、萨满的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a> 夫妻、父母的运势是相互影响的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1149">19:09</a> 了凡四训对后人的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1268">21:08</a> 真正的修行是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家理性看待玄学，信但不迷</span></p><span></span><p><span>今晚不睡，等你们～</span></p>]]></description>
