    <title>「九紫离火运」发财容易，结婚难</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/654bab235e08e4e313b09dff</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">654bab235e08e4e313b09dff</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 Nov 2023 15:37:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈哈！大家久等了，这一期其实早就剪出来了，但一直没有好听的音乐配它，所以一直没发（快给我推荐音乐😁</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpCxD8ciNJMzfAwoHJPi3T4sk7Am.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>这一期主要讲：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>为什么说2024年是女性崛起的时代</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>到底哪些行业会爆火，哪些人会乘九紫离火运发财</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>今天请来了我的好朋友玄空星来给大家讲一讲，九紫离火运的这个20年中，我们应该注意什么！拿本记上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> 九子离火运是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 九紫离火运开始时间，以及对国家行业发展的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">02:37</a> 九紫离火运什么样的女人最得势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a> 哪些行业在离火运中会飞速发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 那种八字在离火运下发展更好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="483">08:03</a> 离火运哪些行业开始没落</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a> 离火运会让我们更关注自己，更自私？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1091">18:11</a> 离火运怎么选房子风水好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1353">22:33</a> 离火运怎么才能旺桃花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1458">24:18</a> 桃花屋怎么选</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这一期离火运的知识篇能对大家有帮助</span></p><span></span><p><span>期待大家的讨论，今晚不睡等你们😯</span></p>]]></description>
